{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"001aef3d6de42f7b2a32a3dbd3da8846f41a0f42c38c0b78541aa4c0763c3700","ja":"お姉さんは誰？","zh":"姐姐是谁？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f461aee483218fe1f92233cdcf52e1010eae8347df083125730a98eb7897ff5a","ja":"すっごく、おいしかったね♪","zh":"超级、超级好吃呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8fb0ae3e0e68150028c2bda16b6f084b44b8b73d7bf33d12b73b73fb80af9917","ja":"ひびき、ごちそうさまー！\nでも、本当に、たまきたちはお金払わなくっていいの？","zh":"响，多谢款待——！\n可是，环她们真的不用付钱吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bc93a9e1281a680eb84811b75280e84075530d0dfaa1aa9fb8b73267ad070293","ja":"もちろんだぞ！　自分はお姉さんだからね！","zh":"当然啦！我可是姐姐呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"53f77143a2ee11b1a0ac61bb51350ffd5a6959fb320dca69d35e29228c81f183","ja":"……でも自分、まだまだだよね。もっと、\nお姉さんっぽいことができるようになりたいぞ……。","zh":"……不过自己还差得远呢。\n真希望能变得更像个大姐姐一样啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2c4ea326d8b527943e67b8dac9afe34ab729958e8ec7f880ca3c492593405dbf","ja":"お姉さんっぽいこと？　……わたしは、\n響さんはあげ物ができてすごい、って思うよ？","zh":"像大姐姐一样的事？……我觉得，\n响会做炸物就很了不起了哦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d5249114f6fd5a79909fa4ae31ff4e5abe363737503275804c782240422a1d35","ja":"揚げ物を作れるのが、お姉さんなの！？\nでも環もこの前、サーターアンダギー作れてたよね？","zh":"会做油炸食品，就是大姐姐了吗！？\n不过环前阵子，也做出了开口笑对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"91435cec480130d0d2a6fa5a09c6d7a41d296714dc1bef152d5d1c7fd8f2b86d","ja":"たまきが作れたのは、\nひびきが教えてくれたからだぞ？","zh":"环能做出来，\n是因为响教了环哦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a522ca8171f6d895be0e91e0d8065b22c6bda8ca236b6a57c225d6df8acc693b","ja":"油が熱くなりすぎたときは、\n危ないって助けてくれたし。","zh":"油温过高的时候，\n还提醒我很危险，帮了我呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"444a2455faf9c67d1df6ecc52f280d4e1ef05a3ee31ecd7f7dda495b92b8c8f9","ja":"うん、あの時の響さん、かっこよかったよ！","zh":"嗯，那时候的响小姐真的很帅气哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f1dd9c99174218c4ae1187fa4c620ddc5225cb53155e8503a6bc17e883764fcf","ja":"むずかしいあげ物も、準備からお片付けまで\n全部ひとりでできるなんて、やっぱりすごいよね！","zh":"连难度很高的油炸食品，都能从准备到收拾\n全凭自己一个人搞定，果然好厉害呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"88145f7158407744501a71e739ade117cbbd39c0e3daa650a62070cd15c533d3","ja":"うん、ひびきはかっこいいよ！\nすごいお姉さんだぞ！","zh":"嗯，响很帅气哦！\n是个非常厉害的大姐姐呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"22b0bf47448d6534b30c0b80f07a050d6532153a1e9def86763d3bc78a86bc69","ja":"そ、そっか～……えへへへへ～♪","zh":"这、这样啊～……嘿嘿嘿嘿～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"f8c67fdf6c0d75ee7086cfced6952aff8ceaaaa173d2db15ada57080adcaaf38","ja":"次の日……","zh":"第二天……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"dd3ac4544b61bb37e768c9d244dcae1ed2a5ed996079b92b1a27639b732da8dd","ja":"……それで、こんなにたくさんの\nサーターアンダギーがあるってわけね。","zh":"……所以才会有这么多的\n开口笑啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"ba1bdd0e73d95f8d6f91f91b348f135be27c72f909c16634977c113921b47e13","ja":"えへへっ♪　お姉さんっぽいところを見せたくって、\nつい張り切って、いっぱい作っちゃったぞ！","zh":"嘿嘿♪ 想展现出大姐姐的样子，\n一不小心就干劲十足，做了好多呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"bb182116e3f1aacf6e271509247b70529309759f41489563696381af52e07ae2","ja":"でも、話を聞いていると、\n育と環のほうがお姉さんなんじゃない？","zh":"不过，听你这么说，\n育和环反而更像姐姐吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"b94225972c27e8787b286f978fbf609a13f79a3b7b30ab2eb77fa6518549ab54","ja":"落ち込んでる響を励まして、\n元気づけてくれるなんて。","zh":"不仅安慰了沮丧的响，\n还让她重新振作了起来。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"930577d736e5a85ba4dfce53decff254d5c9492936cc0d573c46e499ad167bb0","ja":"えっ……ああ～～～っ！\nほ、ほんとだ～～～っ！？","zh":"诶……啊啊～～～！\n真、真的耶～～～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1755.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"8dadd52806d49a92cb1d0181d2397e5d8ac03d52346aca7e5ef30cbb18df54cd","ja":"うう……自分ってやっぱり、\nお姉さんじゃないのかも……。","zh":"呜呜……果然我可能，\n算不上是什么大姐姐吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
